# Admin detail page design

User taste: **minimal, clean, intuitive** — no redundant info, French-first copy, no centered max-width column. Prefer quiet visuals and a clear hierarchy.

Use shared primitives in `components/admin/detail/`.

References:
- Student detail: `app/admin/students/[id]/page.tsx`
- Class detail: `app/admin/classes/[id]/page.tsx`

## List → detail pattern

Admin entity **lists** (e.g. classes) should prefer a searchable `Table` with:
- Important columns only
- Row click → detail/overview (`onRowClick`)
- Row actions in ⋯ (`getRowActions`)
- One primary CTA on the page (e.g. Ajouter une classe)
- Lean list APIs (no heavy nested assignment graphs on list fetch)

Class overview tabs fold former `/admin/classes/[id]/students` and `.../subjects` into one place.

## Layout

- Full-width, left-aligned — same as other admin pages (`space-y-4` / `DetailShell`).
- **Do not** center content or use `max-w-[960–1100px]`.
- Hierarchy: breadcrumb → compact header → small KPI row → tabs → panels.
- Cards: `DetailCard` — `rounded-[10px]`, `border border-(--border-subtle)`, `bg-(--surface)`.
- No gradients, heavy shadows, or blurs. Transitions `0.15s`. Follow `.cursorrules` for light mode.

## Header

`DetailHeader`:

- Title = entity name (20px / 600).
- One status badge only (`StatusPill`) — Active / Left (or equivalent).
- Meta = one muted line (`class · admission`). No year/gender/login chrome in the header.
- **No visible primary button.** No secondary text links (no `Fees →`, no Edit).
- Actions = `ActionMenu` (⋯) only, on the right.

## Actions / More menu

- Put Edit, status, login create/remove, parent password, message parent, etc. in the ⋯ menu.
- Login must **not** appear on the main page (no badge, no hint). Login management stays menu-only.
- Destructive items: `tone: 'danger'` + `separatorBefore`.
- Escape + outside-click handled by `ActionMenu`. Pass a French `label` for aria.

## KPI strip

- `KpiStrip` — 2–3 essential metrics only (e.g. attendance %, average, outstanding fees).
- Do not duplicate KPI values inside the default tab.

## Tabs & redundancy

- `DetailTabs` — brand active underline `#635bff`.
- Each fact once (header **or** KPI **or** tab).
- Overview = unique context (contacts, subjects), not a second identity dump.
- Empty states: one short muted sentence.

## Copy / i18n

- Admin UI is French-first. Wire every visible string through locale messages (`studentsDetail` or page-specific keys) with French fallbacks.
- Dates: `toLocaleDateString('fr-FR')` when locale is French.
- No leftover hardcoded English on the page (labels, tabs, toasts, confirms, aria-labels, empty states).

## Theme tokens (light + dark)

| Role | Use |
|------|-----|
| Surfaces | `bg-(--surface)`, `bg-(--surface-soft)` |
| Borders | `border-(--border-subtle)` |
| Text | `ui-text-primary`, `ui-text-secondary` |
| Overlay | `bg-[var(--overlay)]` |
| Danger | `text-[var(--danger)]` |
| Brand | `#635bff` / hover `#5146e8` |

Status pills: use `.ui-status` / `.ui-status-success|pending|danger|neutral` from `globals.css`.
These react to `html[data-theme='dark']` — **do not** rely on Tailwind `dark:` (this app uses `data-theme`).

## Shared components

| Piece | Path |
|-------|------|
| Shell / card / meta / breadcrumb | `components/admin/detail/DetailShell.tsx` |
| Header + status pill | `components/admin/detail/DetailHeader.tsx` |
| KPI strip | `components/admin/detail/KpiStrip.tsx` |
| Tabs | `components/admin/detail/DetailTabs.tsx` |
| More menu | `components/admin/detail/ActionMenu.tsx` |
| Barrel | `components/admin/detail/index.ts` |

## Tables (single system)

Prefer **`components/ui/Table.tsx`** for list pages. For custom markup use:

```html
<div class="ui-table-wrap">
  <table class="ui-table">…</table>
</div>
```

Rules:
- Theme tokens only — never hardcode `#111420`, `text-slate-100`, `text-indigo-200`, or light-only `#f9fafb` stripes.
- Cell text: `ui-text-primary` / `ui-text-secondary`. Links: `ui-table-link`. Avatars: `ui-table-avatar`.
- Status in cells: `.ui-status` / `.ui-status-success|pending|danger|neutral` (data-theme aware).
- Toolbar: search + filters + buttons on one row, matching `h-8` heights (`ui-table-toolbar`).
- Amounts: `font-semibold`. Headers: 11px uppercase muted.
- Do not invent a new table look per page.
